### 12. JSON 응답 구조 분석용 (주석으로 예상 응답)
# Station API 예상 응답:
# {
#   "station": {
#     "user_id": "ecvhao",
#     "user_nick": "우왁굳",
#     "profile_image": "https://profile.img.afreecatv.com/...",
#     "fan_cnt": 293845,
#     "total_view_cnt": 15678234,
#     "broad_start": "2024-01-15T15:30:00+09:00",
#     "broad_grade": "파트너BJ"
#   }
# }

GET https://bjapi.afreecatv.com/api/ecvhao/station
User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36
Accept: application/json

###

### 13. Live API 예상 응답 테스트
# Live API 예상 응답:
# {
#   "CHANNEL": {
#     "RESULT": 1,  // 1=라이브, 0=오프라인
#     "TITLE": "방송 제목",
#     "BNO": "268443123",
#     "CATE": "토크/캠방", 
#     "TOTAL_VIEW_CNT": "1234",
#     "CATEGORY_TAGS": ["태그1", "태그2"]
#   }
# }

POST https://live.afreecatv.com/afreeca/player_live_api.php
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36
Accept: application/json

bid=ecvhao

###

### 14. CORS 테스트 (OPTIONS 요청)
OPTIONS https://bjapi.afreecatv.com/api/ecvhao/station
Origin: http://localhost:3000
Access-Control-Request-Method: GET
Access-Control-Request-Headers: User-Agent

###

### 15. 타임아웃 테스트용 (느린 응답)
GET https://bjapi.afreecatv.com/api/ecvhao/station
User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36
Accept: application/json
# @note 응답 시간 체크

